ION) — needs: Masonry, Horseback Riding [Boost: Build a Water Mill.]\\n  Engineering (TECH_ENGINEERING) — needs: Wheel [Boost: Build Ancient Walls.]\\n  -- MEDIEVAL --\\n  Military Tactics (TECH_MILITARY_TACTICS) — needs: Mathematics [Boost: Kill a unit with a Spearman.]\\n  Apprenticeship (TECH_APPRENTICESHIP) — needs: Currency, Horseback Riding [Boost: Build 3 Mines.]\\n  Machinery (TECH_MACHINERY) — needs: Iron Working, Engineering [Boost: Own 3 Archers.]\\n  Education (TECH_EDUCATION) — needs: Mathematics, Apprenticeship [Boost: Earn a Great Scientist.]\\n  Stirrups (TECH_STIRRUPS) — needs: Horseback Riding, Apprenticeship [Boost: Have the Feudalism civic.]\\n  Military Engineering (TECH_MILITARY_ENGINEERING) — needs: Construction [Boost: Build an Aqueduct.]\\n  Castles (TECH_CASTLES) — needs: Construction [Boost: Adopt a government with 6 inherent policy slots.]\\n  Buttress (TECH_BUTTRESS) — needs: Shipbuilding, Mathematics [Boost: Build a Classical era or later wonder]\\n\\nLocked civics (prerequisites missing):\\n  -- ANCIENT --\\n  Craftsmanship (CIVIC_CRAFTSMANSHIP) — needs: Code of Laws [Boost: Improve 3 tiles.]\\n  Foreign Trade (CIVIC_FOREIGN_TRADE) — needs: Code of Laws [Boost: Discover a second continent.]\\n  Military Tradition (CIVIC_MILITARY_TRADITION) — needs: Craftsmanship [Boost: Clear a Barbarian Outpost.]\\n  State Workforce (CIVIC_STATE_WORKFORCE) — needs: Craftsmanship [Boost: Build any specialty district.]\\n  Early Empire (CIVIC_EARLY_EMPIRE) — needs: Foreign Trade [Boost: Grow your civilization to at least 6 population.]\\n  Mysticism (CIVIC_MYSTICISM) — needs: Foreign Trade [Boost: Found a pantheon.]\\n  -- CLASSICAL --\\n  Games and Recreation (CIVIC_GAMES_RECREATION) — needs: State Workforce [Boost: Research the Construction technology.]\\n  Political Philosophy (CIVIC_POLITICAL_PHILOSOPHY) — needs: State Workforce, Early Empire [Boost: Meet 3 city-states.]\\n  Drama and Poetry (CIVIC_DRAMA_POETRY) — needs: Early Empire [Boost: Build a